                  },
                  {
                    "content_type": "block",
                    "type": "text",
                    "data": {
                      "content": "<p style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\">Our first batch is being made right now. We’ll email you the moment it ships — nothing to do until then. First-batch members get first dibs, so your spot is held.</p>",
