                    "content_type": "block",
                    "type": "text",
                    "data": {
                      "content": "<p style=\"margin:0;\">Made by a small team in Lexington, Kentucky. Say hi any time — just reply to this email.</p><p style=\"margin:14px 0 0;\">Instagram &amp; TikTok: <a href=\"https://instagram.com/sipqtmatcha\" style=\"color:#2e4b21;\">@sipqtmatcha</a></p>",
